# Wave T25 (Meadowbrook register): the Heron — the designed
# resident of the east pond, standing in the shallows at the
# path end on its north-west bank, judging the water the way
# the approved painting and the BACKSTORY-SYNC row put it
# ("a trainer's stance is judged the way a heron judges
# water — by what does not ripple"). Rendered as a PROP: the
# backend records no heron NPC, so it gets no name, no
# dialogue, no quest — it simply stands there, level-eyed.
# Grey body, folded dark wing, S-neck, ochre beak and legs,
# a ripple arc at its feet. FULLY OPAQUE with the town's
# rendered meadow baked in: the engine's tg- underlay base
# (tile-tg-petalburg's sage) does not match the meadow as
# this town renders it, so — exactly like the scales crown —
# the ground it stands on is baked, never transparency.
# (WAVE-T25-MEADOWBROOK-PLAN.md, Prop register.)
PIX tile-prop-heron 16 16
